{"_path":"/zh/blog/vsvode-mouse-lost","_dir":"blog","_draft":false,"_partial":false,"_locale":"","title":"VSCode 中看不清鼠标？一招解决！","description":"最近在使用 VSCode 时，我遇到了一个让人头疼的问题：在浅色背景中，鼠标光标变得难以看清，尤其是在终端和编辑器之间切换时，光标会变成白色，几乎看不见。这个问题在 Windows 系统上尤为明显，尤其是使用 AMD 显卡时。","date":"2025-02-04 10:55","tags":["vscode","tool"],"excerpt":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"最近在使用 VSCode 时，我遇到了一个让人头疼的问题：在浅色背景中，鼠标光标变得难以看清，尤其是在终端和编辑器之间切换时，光标会变成白色，几乎看不见。这个问题在 Windows 系统上尤为明显，尤其是使用 AMD 显卡时。"}]}]},"body":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"最近在使用 VSCode 时，我遇到了一个让人头疼的问题：在浅色背景中，鼠标光标变得难以看清，尤其是在终端和编辑器之间切换时，光标会变成白色，几乎看不见。这个问题在 Windows 系统上尤为明显，尤其是使用 AMD 显卡时。"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"经过一番搜索，我终于找到了解决办法。参考了 "},{"type":"element","tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode/issues/204181","rel":["nofollow"]},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"VSCode 的 GitHub Issue"}]},{"type":"text","value":" 后，我发现这个问题是由 VSCode 基于 Chromium 的渲染机制导致的。在某些情况下，VSCode 的硬件加速或直接合成渲染可能会导致鼠标光标颜色异常，尤其是在浅色背景下。"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"h2","props":{"id":"解决办法"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"解决办法"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"h3","props":{"id":"方法一禁用硬件加速disable-hardware-acceleration"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"方法一：禁用硬件加速（disable-hardware-acceleration）"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"ol","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"strong","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"通过设置文件"}]},{"type":"text","value":"："},{"type":"element","tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"打开 VSCode，按下 "},{"type":"element","tag":"code","props":{"className":[]},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Ctrl + Shift + P"}]},{"type":"text","value":"，输入 "},{"type":"element","tag":"code","props":{"className":[]},"chil